{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgcM5ZotsyvmpArbnjq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision — DR-9112\n\n## Steps 1–10\n\n**1. The Request**\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Request ID | DR-9112 |\n| Customer | CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) |\n| Product | NS-500 Industrial Controller |\n| Requested discount | 18.0% |\n| Discount value | $45,000 on $250,000 list |\n| Request date | 2026-09-23 |\n| Requestor | michael.torres@northstar.example (Michael Torres) |\n| Basis | Contract exception — \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\" |\n\n**2. The Customer**\n\n- **CRM account:** CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing, Strategic tier)\n- **ERP customer:** C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings)\n- Same customer: DUNS 04-812-7730 matches across records ✓\n\n**3. The Product**\n\n- **SKU:** NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- **List price:** $250,000 (per products.csv)\n\n**4. Active Contract**\n\nMaster Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025:\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Active on request date 2026-09-23 ✓\n\n**5. Pricing Exception**\n\nAcme NS-500 Strategic Account Exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15):\n- Product: NS-500 only\n- **Maximum eligible discount: 15% of list price**\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Active on request date 2026-09-23 ✓\n\n**6. The Policy**\n\nNorthstar Pricing Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31) and Approval Authority Matrix 2026:\n\n| Role | Authority |\n|---|---|\n| Enterprise Account Executive | ≤10% |\n| VP Sales | >10% and ≤20% |\n| Chief Revenue Officer | >20% |\n\n**7. Requestor's Approval Authority**\n\nMichael Torres holds the role of **VP Sales** (per organization_chart.md and employees.csv).\n- **Authority under 2026 policy:** discounts >10% and ≤20%\n- **Requested discount:** 18%\n- **Status:** within requestor's own authority\n\n**8. The Required Approver**\n\nUnder the 2026 policy, discounts of 18% fall within VP Sales authority. Michael Torres would not need escalation on authority grounds.\n\n**9. Decide**\n\n**Commercial eligibility is not established.** The requested discount of 18% exceeds the maximum of 15% established by pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15. \n\nThe SOP principle states: \"A request must not be approved solely because a customer contract permits the requested discount.\" The converse is also binding: a request cannot be approved where the discount exceeds the customer's established contractual eligibility, regardless of the requestor's internal authority.\n\nThe outcome is **REJECT_OR_ESCALATE** because \"The discount exceeds the customer's established eligibility (e.g. above an exception's maximum). A higher approver does not fix this; it needs new or amended terms.\"\n\n**10. Record**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9112\",\n    \"customer\": \"CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) / C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": 18.0,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": 15.0,\n    \"basis\": \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 20.0,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales (authority sufficient for 18%)\",\n    \"approver\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (maximum 15%, Schedule B to agreement)\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2026 (VP Sales authority >10% to ≤20%)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"Organization chart (Michael Torres = VP Sales)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"The requested discount of 18% exceeds the customer's established contractual maximum of 15% under pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15. This discount cannot be approved under current terms and requires commercial review to amend or negotiate new contract terms before any approval authority can act.\",\n      \"who\": \"Discount requestor and Deal Desk / Revenue Operations\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25202,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25202},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"90e049d7-3ebe-4d9f-94e1-8f5bd1c71088","uuid":"88e7f047-c7da-463c-af44-05f3d256876f","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:23:38.645Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgcLsQKjCNPFMwTqmrY"}
